# Keep the build context small and free of host state/secrets.
.git/
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
secondbrain-template/
*.md
# ...but the image bakes in the agent base prompt and skills, which ARE markdown.
# Re-include them (negations after the *.md rule above) so the Containerfile's
# COPY of container/CLAUDE.md and container/skills can see them in the context.
!container/CLAUDE.md
!container/skills/**
